// The classic UVL sandwich — edit me!
features
    Experiment
        mandatory
            Program
                alternative
                    OriginalC
                    LLMC
                    LLMPython

            Property
                alternative
                    AddAssociativity
                    MulAssociativity
                    Distributivity

            NumericType
                alternative
                    Float
                    Double

            Repetitions
                alternative
                    R100
                    R1000
                    R10000

            Environment
                alternative
                    GCC12
                    GCC13
                    GCC14
                    Python311

constraints
    LLMPython => Python311
    (OriginalC | LLMC) => (GCC12 | GCC13 | GCC14)
